set_panelplan(2,'RF_S1E02_A06',["Wide: Dominion above the council table; the proposed green lane glows inside the blockade.","Dominion closes the lane on the map. Venn reaches in and restores one narrow route.","Keating throws a weapons-scan image beside the route; Venn watches her, not the display.","Rhyne taps the civilian cargo totals. Dominion turns on him for the final exchange."])
