set_panelplan(2,'RF_S1E02_A16',["Wide office/docks: two available supply ships are visible beyond Halev and Jex; the manifest shows a required total of eight.","Jex taps the two existing ships on the slate and adds four more while answering.","Halev does not move when he repeats that he needs six from Jex.","Jex leans back from the slate and asks whether Halev knows another smuggler. Naomi watches from the window.","Silence on Halev. Then: 'Okay. Five.'","Jex irritably adds the fifth ship to the manifest and complains that he is getting weak or lazy."])
D(2,'RF_S1E02_A17',[('@starsplit.naomi.sol','Naomi','No inspections?'),('@starsplit.jex.marrin','Jex','You want them on time?'),('@starsplit.halev','Halev','Rapid scans. No holds unless somebody finds a weapon.'),('@starsplit.jex.marrin','Jex','And disputes?'),('@starsplit.halev','Halev','You. For now.'),('@starsplit.naomi.sol','Naomi',"He's going to make that his title."),('@starsplit.jex.marrin','Jex','Already did.')]); set_direction(2,'RF_S1E02_A17',"The five-ship deal is now written on a slate between them. Naomi takes the slate and reads the inspection clause aloud. Halev edits the terms with a stylus while Jex watches for the one provision that gives him leverage. When Halev gives him temporary arbitration authority, Jex immediately stamps his own mark beside it. Naomi sees what he has done before Halev does.")
D(2,'RF_S1E02_A18',[('@starsplit.naomi.sol','Naomi',"Blue Three, ease left. That's it. Hold there."),('@starsplit.ella.venn','Venn','Thunderbreak is outside your lane. Weapons cold.')]); set_direction(2,'RF_S1E02_A18',"The first five freighters enter the green markers with heater cores, medpods, batteries and food visible through cargo apertures. Naomi is busy correcting one escort's spacing; Venn's confirmation comes over comms while Thunderbreak holds just outside the lane. Tess appears at the far edge without announcing herself. The tension comes from armed ships watching one another and choosing not to fire.")
